# CAD and rendered assets are checked out byte-for-byte. STEP is technically
# text, so git will happily normalise its line endings, which changes the file
# between platforms for no benefit and breaks any hash anyone takes of it. These
# are extracted geometry, not source to be diffed - store and restore verbatim.
*.step -text
*.stp  -text
*.stl  -text
*.glb  -text
*.gltf -text
*.hdr  -text
